**fixdeps.sh reconstructs broken Git submodules from `.gitmodules`.**

## Behavior

`set -e` aborts on failure; `git config` matches `^submodule\..*\.path`, reads `.url`/`.branch`, and echoes `git submodule add` commands.

## Interface

`fixdeps.sh` exports no symbols; requires Git and POSIX shell (though `[[ ... ]]` is non-POSIX).